Subject: Support OpenAI Responses API for tool calls

GPT-5.6 tool calls need the Responses API when reasoning is enabled or when a
restricted API key does not grant access to Chat Completions. Keep the legacy
endpoint as the default, but allow an nr_llm configuration to select
`api_mode: responses`. Also forward `reasoning_effort` on the legacy path so
operators can explicitly disable reasoning there.

